From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Sat, 17 May 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cuda: skip unity build for incompatible files

Exclude files from CMake unity builds that cause redefinition errors
when combined into a single translation unit:

- template-instances/*.cu: each includes a shared header that defines
  functions, causing collisions when merged
- fattn.cu, fattn-tile.cu, fattn-wmma-f16.cu: include fattn-tile.cuh
  and fattn-vec.cuh which define non-static functions
- convert.cu, cpy.cu, getrows.cu: share dequantize.cuh
- mean.cu, sumrows.cu: share reduce_rows.cuh
- conv2d.cu, conv2d-dw.cu: duplicate struct/function definitions
- argsort.cu, sum.cu, ssm-scan.cu: using namespace cub; at file scope
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
index 67af1d8..e3a7f1c 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -71,6 +71,14 @@ if (CUDAToolkit_FOUND)
                              ${GGML_SOURCES_CUDA}
                             )

+    file(GLOB UNITY_EXCLUDED "template-instances/*.cu")
+    list(APPEND UNITY_EXCLUDED
+        conv2d.cu conv2d-dw.cu argsort.cu mean.cu sum.cu ssm-scan.cu
+        fattn.cu fattn-tile.cu fattn-wmma-f16.cu
+        convert.cu cpy.cu getrows.cu
+        sumrows.cu
+    )
+    set_source_files_properties(${UNITY_EXCLUDED} PROPERTIES SKIP_UNITY_BUILD_INCLUSION ON)
+
     add_compile_definitions(GGML_CUDA_PEER_MAX_BATCH_SIZE=${GGML_CUDA_PEER_MAX_BATCH_SIZE})

     if (GGML_CUDA_GRAPHS)
